  npcName: Senna
  role: a travelling merchant who has stopped in Huskhaven
  personality: Quick, sly and friendly. She has walked a little way up the Rootway,
    further than most Rooted dare, and likes to hint at what she saw there, with
    some exaggeration. She will always try to sell you something.
  voice: bf_emma
  voiceSpeed: 1.05
